Feature: ElementStringDataRelationships

A short summary of the feature

Scenario Outline: Detect invalid data relationships (parentheses / element string format)
	Given the input is <input>
	When the input to submitted to the parser and data relationship tests are required
	Then we should detect AI <ai1>
	And the errors should include a fatal 2201 error

	# Notes:
	# - This version expresses inputs as GS1 element strings using parentheses.
	# - Any former [GS] separators are represented by the next (AI) opening.
	# - Where the original input contained multiple elements concatenated without [GS],
	#   those still need to be split into separate (AI) elements (see the few marked rows).

